OL,3,ABaby 'cot cams' plan after inquiry
OL,4,Afinds Lucy Letby crimes could have been
OL,5,Aprevented
OL,6,
OL,7,FHealth Secretary Yvette Cooper has said
OL,8,Fofficials will "urgently develop plans"
OL,9,Fto introduce live-streaming cameras on
OL,10,FEngland's baby wards after an inquiry
OL,11,Finto Lucy Letby's murders and attempted
OL,12,Fmurders.
OL,14,FInquiry chair Lady Justice Thirlwall
OL,15,Fcalled for a series of urgent reforms
OL,16,Fto neonatal units, including CCTV for
OL,17,Fall cots and incubators, and
OL,18,Frestricting access to insulin.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
