OL,3,ABaby 'cot cams' plan after inquiry
OL,4,Afinds Lucy Letby crimes could have been
OL,5,Aprevented
OL,6,
OL,7,FThirlwall said some of the babies Letby
OL,8,Fkilled could have been saved if
OL,9,Fmanagers at the Countess of Chester
OL,10,FHospital had taken action earlier.
OL,12,FHer report criticises a "complete
OL,13,Ffailure to protect babies" and a
OL,14,F"profound failure of management,
OL,15,Fgovernance and safeguarding" at the
OL,16,Fhospital.
